HHIISSTTOORRYY
     EFI boot support for the ia64 architecture first appeared in FreeBSD 5.0.
     UUEEFFII boot support for amd64 first appeared in FreeBSD 10.1; for arm64 in
     FreeBSD 11.0; for armv6 and armv7 in FreeBSD 12.0; and for riscv in
     FreeBSD 13.0.

BBUUGGSS
     There is no support for 32-bit i386 booting via UEFI.

